{{h1}}Go Templates
- Follow named-template, pipeline, function-map, and whitespace-trimming conventions.
- Use `html/template` for HTML output and preserve its contextual escaping; use `text/template` only where appropriate.
- Keep application behaviour in Go and validate rendered output.

{{h2}}Reference
- [Go text/template](https://pkg.go.dev/text/template)
- [Go html/template](https://pkg.go.dev/html/template)
